Value Required slot (\d+)
Value Required sensor (\S+\s+\d+)
Value temperature_celsius (-?[\d.]+)
Value temperature_high_warning_celsius (-?[\d.]+)
Value temperature_high_alarm_celsius (-?[\d.]+)

Start
  ^Slot Subslot -> Router
  ^\s*${slot}\s+${sensor}\s+${temperature_celsius}\s+\S+\s+(?:${temperature_high_warning_celsius}|NA)\s+(?:${temperature_high_alarm_celsius}|NA)\s+\S+\s*$$ -> Record

Router
  ^\s*${slot}\s+\d+\s+${sensor}\s+${temperature_celsius}\s+\S+\s+(?:${temperature_high_warning_celsius}|NA)\s+(?:${temperature_high_alarm_celsius}|NA)\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
